{
  "title": "Neo4j Enterprise — Production Health Dashboard",
  "description": "Production health overview for Neo4j Enterprise: query latency, page cache, heap, transactions, cluster, GC, store growth, Bolt, and incident hotspot Cypher.",
  "layout_type": "ordered",
  "widgets": [
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Query Performance",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "display_type": "line",
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "p50",
                "query": "p50:neo4j.db.query.execution.latency.milliseconds{*}"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "p95",
                "query": "p95:neo4j.db.query.execution.latency.milliseconds{*}"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "p99",
                "query": "p99:neo4j.db.query.execution.latency.milliseconds{*}"
              }
            ],
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "style": {
              "palette": "dog_classic",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "milliseconds",
          "include_zero": true
        },
        "show_legend": true
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Page Cache Hit Ratio",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "query_value",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "hits",
                "query": "sum:neo4j.db.page_cache.hits{*}.as_count()"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "misses",
                "query": "sum:neo4j.db.page_cache.misses{*}.as_count()"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "hits / (hits + misses) * 100"
              }
            ],
            "conditional_formats": [
              {
                "comparator": ">",
                "value": 99,
                "palette": "white_on_green"
              },
              {
                "comparator": ">",
                "value": 95,
                "palette": "white_on_yellow"
              },
              {
                "comparator": "<",
                "value": 95,
                "palette": "white_on_red"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "autoscale": true,
        "precision": 2,
        "custom_unit": "%"
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "JVM Heap Utilization",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "display_type": "line",
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "used",
                "query": "avg:neo4j.jvm.memory.heap.used_bytes{*}"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "max",
                "query": "avg:neo4j.jvm.memory.heap.max_bytes{*}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "alias": "heap_utilization_pct",
                "formula": "used / max * 100"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "markers": [
          {
            "value": "y = 85",
            "display_type": "error dashed",
            "label": "Critical 85%"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "%",
          "min": "0",
          "max": "100",
          "include_zero": true
        },
        "show_legend": true
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Active Transactions",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "display_type": "line",
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "active",
                "query": "avg:neo4j.db.transaction.active{*}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "alias": "active_transactions",
                "formula": "anomalies(active, 'basic', 2)"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true,
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "transactions",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Transaction Throughput",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "display_type": "line",
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "committed",
                "query": "sum:neo4j.db.transaction.committed_total{*}.as_rate()"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "rollbacks",
                "query": "sum:neo4j.db.transaction.rollbacks_total{*}.as_rate()"
              }
            ],
            "style": {
              "palette": "dog_classic",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true,
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "tx/s",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Cluster Health",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "table",
        "requests": [
          {
            "response_format": "scalar",
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "replication_lag",
                "query": "avg:neo4j.cluster.raft.replication_lag{*} by {host,neo4j_role,neo4j_status}"
              }
            ],
            "formulas": [
              {
                "formula": "replication_lag",
                "limit": {
                  "count": 50,
                  "order": "desc"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "has_search_bar": "auto"
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "GC Pause Time",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "display_type": "line",
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "gc_pause",
                "query": "avg:neo4j.jvm.gc.pause.time{*}.as_rate()"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "markers": [
          {
            "value": "y = 0.5",
            "display_type": "warning dashed",
            "label": "Alert 500ms"
          }
        ],
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "seconds (rate)",
          "include_zero": true
        },
        "show_legend": true
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Store Size Growth",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "live_span": "1w",
        "requests": [
          {
            "display_type": "line",
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "store_size",
                "query": "avg:neo4j.db.store.size.total.bytes{*}"
              }
            ],
            "style": {
              "palette": "cool",
              "line_type": "solid",
              "line_width": "normal"
            }
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true,
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "bytes",
          "include_zero": false,
          "scale": "linear"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Bolt Connection Rate",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "requests": [
          {
            "display_type": "line",
            "response_format": "timeseries",
            "queries": [
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "opened",
                "query": "sum:neo4j.bolt.connections.opened_total{*}.as_rate()"
              },
              {
                "data_source": "metrics",
                "name": "closed",
                "query": "sum:neo4j.bolt.connections.closed_total{*}.as_rate()"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "show_legend": true,
        "yaxis": {
          "label": "connections/s",
          "include_zero": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "definition": {
        "title": "Incident Hotspot Query (Q3)",
        "title_size": "16",
        "title_align": "left",
        "type": "note",
        "content": "## High-incident applications (Q3)\n\nUse this Cypher during latency or application incidents to find apps with more than `$minIncidents` related incidents.\n\n**Instructions**\n1. Open Neo4j Browser or `cypher-shell` against the affected database.\n2. Set `:param minIncidents => 3` (or lower during triage).\n3. Run the production query below.\n4. Cross-check slow queries via `CALL dbms.listQueries()` and the troubleshooting runbook.\n\n```cypher\nMATCH (a:Application)<-[:AFFECTS]-(i:Incident)\nWITH a,\n     count(i) AS incident_count,\n     collect(i.title) AS incident_titles,\n     collect(i.severity) AS severities\nWHERE incident_count > $minIncidents\nRETURN a.name AS application_name,\n       a.applicationId AS applicationId,\n       a.tier AS tier,\n       incident_count,\n       incident_titles,\n       severities\nORDER BY incident_count DESC;\n```\n\nSource: `cypher/queries/q3_high_incident_apps.cypher`",
        "background_color": "white",
        "font_size": "14",
        "text_align": "left",
        "vertical_align": "top",
        "show_tick": false
      }
    }
  ],
  "template_variables": [
    {
      "name": "env",
      "prefix": "env",
      "available_values": ["prod", "staging"],
      "default": "prod"
    }
  ],
  "reflow_type": "auto"
}
